📣 Announcing the immediate availability of:

- PHP 8.2.33
- PHP 8.3.33
- PHP 8.4.24
- PHP 8.5.9

‼️ These address the following security issues:

- Leak on double DatePeriod::__construct() call
- Upgrade libgd
- SQL-injection via E'...' backslash breakout
- Crash via recursive symlinks
- OOB write in bccomp()

📝 https://www.php.net/ChangeLog-8.php
🎁 https://www.php.net/downloads
